let rearrangedPhrase = rearrangePhrase(originalPhrase)
print(rearrangedPhrase) // Outputs "Discover love in your gjiehworthliving"
```
This will give you a new phrase, such as "Discover love in your gjiehworthliving," which encourages a positive outlook on life.

