 It looks like your `generateRandomPlanets` function is trying to place new planets randomly within a certain distance from existing ones. However, the current implementation has a few issues that can lead to too many attempts being made or planets being placed too close to each other.

Firstly, the `randomPosition` function takes three arguments but is only called with two, which might result in unexpected behavior. I assume it was meant to take three arguments, so we will adjust the function call accordingly.

